  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Navan (formerly TripActions) is a corporate travel and expense platform for mid-market and enterprise teams — flight/hotel/car booking, policy enforcement, expense capture, approvals, and reporting. Pricing is quote-based (2026-08-19): no universal public rate card; typical packaging is per active traveler or company contract. Scored in the HR cluster as people-platform / finance-ops adjacent — not a core HRIS or payroll product.",
    "bestFor": [
      "Mid-market and enterprise teams with frequent business travel",
      "Finance + HR ops wanting unified T&E policy and booking",
      "Companies outgrowing ad-hoc expense spreadsheets"
